  "description": "【 Brushless Motor】Experience the ultimate ride with our high-powered electric bike, equipped with a brushless motor\n【Li-ion Battery】Actbest Race electric bike for adults with high-performance removable battery can travel 40-65 miles on a single charge, and make ebike ideal for urban commuting, long-distance travel and recreational cycling.\n【Dual Brake System】Distributing braking force between the electric bike front and rear wheels helps prevent skidding and loss of control, particularly on slippery or uneven surfaces.\n【Adjustable Seat and Handlebar】Introducing an e-bike designed for the whole family! Our adjustable handlebars and seats cater to riders of all sizes, ensuring a comfortable and personalized cycling experience for everyone.\n【Fork Suspension】Experience the epitome of riding excellence with our advanced ebike boasting a front fork suspension for a smooth, responsive journey over any terrain.\n【Lightweight Frame】Engineered for agility and comfort, this electric bike for adults frame combines strength with a feather-light design, allowing you to navigate urban landscapes or conquer trails with ease. (Weighs only 50lbs)",
